# Kitnap, gift not promised: "When this Aura enters, tap enchanted creature. If the gift wasn't promised, put three stun counters on it. You control enchanted creature."
# Bot1 enchants Bot2's untapped Ornithopter: it becomes Bot1's, tapped, with three stun counters, and Bot2 draws nothing (CR 303.4, 701.26a, 122.1d, 702.174).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Kitnap
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Hand.Kitnap.Cast
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = 3
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Battlefield.Kitnap.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
